2
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:06,000
I, Robot is a action, science fiction film directed by Alex Proyas.

3
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:06,000
In 2035, where robots are commonplace and abide by the three laws of
robotics, a technophobic cop investigates an apparent suicide.

4
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:06,000
Suspecting that a robot may be responsible for the death, his
investigation leads him to believe that humanity may be in danger.

5
00:25:00,000 --> 00:25:06,000
Del Spooner, played by Will Smith.

6
00:30:00,000 --> 00:30:06,000
Susan Calvin, played by Bridget Moynahan.

7
00:35:00,000 --> 00:35:06,000
Sonny (voice), played by Alan Tudyk.

8
